WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.2 · Marketing & Communications
Audiences and segmentation

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Group the people you need by what they need from you, and give each group a priority.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your stakeholder map.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Separate early adopters from those who wait for proof.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Base personas on real conversations, not guesses.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You define priority segments and write one persona.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
